Agents:
- smith (default) (Smith)
  Identity: yes, tastefully ✌️ Smith (IDENTITY.md)
  Workspace: ~/Smith
  Agent dir: ~/Smith/agent
  Model: opencode-go/minimax-m3
  Routing rules: 3
  Routing: default (no explicit rules)
- kermit (Kermit)
  Workspace: ~/Agents/kermit
  Agent dir: ~/Agents/kermit/agent
  Model: openai/gpt-5.5
  Routing rules: 1
- cookie (Cookie)
  Workspace: ~/Agents/Cookie
  Agent dir: ~/Agents/Cookie/agent
  Model: google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview
  Routing rules: 1
- beaker (Beaker)
  Workspace: ~/Agents/Beaker
  Agent dir: ~/Agents/Beaker/agent
  Model: opencode-qwen/qwen3.7-max
  Routing rules: 1
- fozzie (Fozzie)
  Workspace: ~/Agents/Fozzie
  Agent dir: ~/Agents/Fozzie/agent
  Model: openrouter/nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free
  Routing rules: 1
Routing rules map channel/account/peer to an agent. Use --bindings for full rules.
Channel status reflects local config/creds. For live health: openclaw channels status --probe.
